@div ŋišgiŋal B

B.32. nin si-a-ni e-du₇ {d}ba-u₂ niŋ₂-zu lu₂ nu-zu
#lem: nin[lady]; si[horn]; du[perfect]; Bau[1]DN; niŋ[thing]; lu[person]; zu[know]
#tr.en: Lady whose horns are perfect (?), @wDN{Bau}, nobody can learn what you are; 
#etcsl: line-id=B.32

B.33. dumu an-na an X-la-ta teš₂ mu-ŋal₂-da mah-di
#lem: dumu[child]; An[1]DN; An[1]DN; X; teš[unity]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]; mahdi[exalted]
